01:09.586 --> 01:11.448
Good morning, pineapple.
早上好，菠萝。

01:12.758 --> 01:14.448
Good morning, Gary.
早上好，加里。

01:15.689 --> 01:17.551
Good morning, world.
早上好，世界。

01:17.655 --> 01:20.034
I'm ready!
我准备好了！

01:20.137 --> 01:21.275
World?
世界？

01:28.034 --> 01:29.172
Talk to me.
跟我说话。

01:29.275 --> 01:30.793
Package, sir.
包裹，先生。

01:31.965 --> 01:33.000
Ah-ha!
啊哈！

01:33.103 --> 01:35.344
I can't believe
it's finally here.
我不敢相信
它终于来了。

01:35.448 --> 01:36.689
There you go.
就这样吧。

01:36.793 --> 01:38.241
Oh, thank you,
thank you, thank you.
哦，谢谢你，
谢谢，谢谢。

01:38.344 --> 01:41.586
Thank you, Mr...
Tennis Balls.
谢谢您，先生...
网球。

01:41.689 --> 01:43.517
That's "Tentacles."
那就是“触手”。

01:44.931 --> 01:47.448
Squidward's last name
is "Tentacles"?
章鱼哥的姓氏
是“触手”吗？

01:47.551 --> 01:48.827
Poor guy.
可怜的家伙。

01:52.000 --> 01:54.620
Hey, check out
Squidward's new snail.
嘿，看看
章鱼哥的新蜗牛。

01:56.862 --> 01:58.724
Fancy.
想要。

01:58.827 --> 02:00.724
So that's what came in the mail.
这就是邮件中收到的内容。

02:00.827 --> 02:03.448
Looks like Gary has
a new little playmate.
看起来加里已经
一个新的小玩伴。

02:03.551 --> 02:05.862
Dream on, SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝，梦想成真。

02:05.965 --> 02:09.689
I wouldn't let Snellie here
play with that mongrel mutt.
我不会让斯内利在这里
和那只杂种狗一起玩。

02:09.793 --> 02:11.862
She's a purebred.
她是纯种。

02:11.965 --> 02:14.931
Wow. A snail made
out of bread.
哇。一只蜗牛做的
没有面包了。

02:15.034 --> 02:16.206
No.
不。

02:16.310 --> 02:18.241
Purebred means
she's of the highest pedigree.
纯种意味着
她的血统最高。

02:18.344 --> 02:19.586
See?
看？

02:19.689 --> 02:21.793
She even has her own papers.
她甚至还有自己的文件。

02:21.896 --> 02:23.586
So if you'll excuse us
所以如果你能原谅我们

02:23.689 --> 02:26.241
Snellie has to start
her training.
斯内利必须开始
她的训练。

02:26.344 --> 02:27.344
Training?
训练？

02:27.448 --> 02:29.000
For Bikini Bottom's snail race.
比基尼泳裤的蜗牛竞赛。

02:29.103 --> 02:31.551
Snellie will be winning
this Sunday.
斯内利将会获胜
这个周日。

02:31.655 --> 02:33.068
Sunday?
星期日？

02:33.172 --> 02:35.448
Well, I guess I can't
enter Gary in that.
嗯，我想我不能
加里也加入其中。

02:35.551 --> 02:36.655
Sunday's laundry day.
周日是洗衣日。

02:36.758 --> 02:38.793
No, SpongeBob.
不，海绵宝宝。

02:38.896 --> 02:42.000
You can't enter Gary
because Gary's a mutt.
你不能进入加里
因为加里是个杂种狗。

02:44.586 --> 02:46.724
Boy, you got that right.
Gary's no...
男孩，你说得对。
加里不...

02:46.827 --> 02:48.448
Hey! What makes you
so sure
嘿！是什么让你
如此确定

02:48.551 --> 02:50.137
Gary couldn't win that race?
加里无法赢得那场比赛？

02:50.241 --> 02:52.034
Papers.
文件。

02:52.137 --> 02:57.379
Hmm, "Property of
Squidward Pimples."
嗯，“财产
章鱼哥痘痘。”

02:57.482 --> 03:00.034
That's Tennisball...
Uh, Tentacles!
这就是网球...
呃，触手！

03:00.137 --> 03:01.689
Come on, Snellie.
来吧，斯内利。

03:01.793 --> 03:02.655
You know what?
你知道吗？

03:02.758 --> 03:04.344
I'm starting to get the idea
我开始明白了

03:04.448 --> 03:07.655
that Squidward thinks
his snail is better than mine.
章鱼哥认为
他的蜗牛比我的好。

03:07.758 --> 03:08.655
No!
不！

03:08.758 --> 03:10.724
Patrick, are you thinking
帕特里克，你在想吗

03:10.827 --> 03:12.034
what I'm thinking?
我在想什么？

03:12.137 --> 03:14.137
Yeah, I should get a snail
是的，我应该养一只蜗牛

03:14.241 --> 03:17.827
and enter it
in that race and
beat Squidward.
并输入它
在那场比赛中和
击败章鱼哥。

03:17.931 --> 03:20.000
Are youthinking
what I'm thinking?
你在想吗
我在想什么？

03:22.689 --> 03:23.862
No, no, no!
不，不，不！

03:23.965 --> 03:26.310
I'm thinking about entering
you in that race
我正在考虑进入
在那场比赛中的你

03:26.413 --> 03:27.931
and beating Squidward's snail!
并击败章鱼哥的蜗牛！

03:28.034 --> 03:29.689
Looks like we're going
看来我们要去

03:29.793 --> 03:32.068
to start our training now,
ladies.
现在开始我们的训练，
女士们。

03:33.413 --> 03:35.724
I call you a lady
to humiliate and demean you.
我称你为女士
羞辱和贬低你。

03:35.827 --> 03:37.620
It's a motivational tool
we coaches use.
这是一个激励工具
我们教练使用。

03:37.724 --> 03:41.000
Hmm, I don't know why
嗯，我不知道为什么

03:41.103 --> 03:44.793
but I think I'll kick
SpongeBob's butt tomorrow.
但我想我会踢
明天海绵宝宝的屁股。

03:45.827 --> 03:48.620
Kelp powder for muscle mass
海带粉增肌

03:48.724 --> 03:51.620
raw eggs 'cause they're cliche
生鸡蛋，因为它们是陈词滥调

03:51.724 --> 03:53.689
and nails for toughness.
和钉子以增强韧性。

03:56.034 --> 03:59.034
Of course I expect you
to eat this.
我当然期待你
吃这个。

03:59.137 --> 04:02.034
It's scientifically designed
to help you win tomorrow.
它是经过科学设计的
帮助您赢得明天。

04:02.137 --> 04:03.482
Gary?
加里？

04:04.620 --> 04:06.931
Wow, pretty good time.
哇，真是一段美好的时光。

04:07.034 --> 04:09.620
Hey, SpongeBob,
check out my new snail.
嘿，海绵宝宝，
看看我的新蜗牛。

04:09.724 --> 04:11.793
Patrick, your snail is a rock.
帕特里克，你的蜗牛是一块石头。

04:11.896 --> 04:13.793
Yeah, thanks. I know.
是的，谢谢。我知道。

04:13.896 --> 04:16.448
He's got nerves of steel.
他有钢铁般的意志。

04:16.551 --> 04:17.689
See you at the big race!
大赛见！

04:17.793 --> 04:19.482
Boy, the competition's
getting tough.
孩子，比赛的
变得强硬。

04:19.586 --> 04:21.206
That's it, Gary.
就是这样，加里。

04:21.310 --> 04:24.275
We are going to start
some serious training right now.
我们要开始了
现在进行一些认真的训练。

04:29.068 --> 04:31.965
All right, Gary,
let's start with some sprints.
好吧，加里，
让我们从一些冲刺开始。

04:32.068 --> 04:34.586
On your mark, set, go!
各就各位，出发！

04:34.689 --> 04:35.827
Go, Gary, go, come on!
走吧，加里，走吧，来吧！

04:35.931 --> 04:38.482
Go, Gary!
It's all yours, Gary!
走吧，加里！
都是你的了，加里！

04:39.758 --> 04:41.068
Gary?
加里？

04:41.172 --> 04:44.413
Come on, Gary,
the big race is tomorrow.
来吧，加里，
大赛就在明天。

04:44.517 --> 04:48.172
You got to start training
if you want to win.
你必须开始训练
如果你想赢。

04:48.275 --> 04:50.310
Don't waste your breath,
SpongeBob.
别浪费口气了
海绵宝宝。

04:50.413 --> 04:54.103
That mongrel of yours
doesn't have a chance
against Snellie.
你那个杂种
没有机会
对阵斯内利。

04:54.206 --> 04:55.034
Excuse me
打扰一下

04:55.137 --> 04:57.793
but you two seem
to be forgetting
但你们两个似乎
被遗忘

04:57.896 --> 05:00.896
who the real winner will be...
My snail.
谁才是真正的赢家……
我的蜗牛。

05:01.000 --> 05:02.758
Patrick, that's a rock.
帕特里克，那是一块石头。

05:02.862 --> 05:04.620
Yeah, thanks. I know.
是的，谢谢。我知道。

05:04.724 --> 05:06.758
He's got nerves of steel.
他有钢铁般的意志。

05:06.862 --> 05:08.379
Hey, what are you
standing on, anyway?
嘿，你是什么
无论如何，坚持下去？

05:09.344 --> 05:10.241
Like I said
就像我说的

05:10.344 --> 05:12.896
don't even bother
showing up tomorrow.
甚至不用打扰
明天出现。

05:14.586 --> 05:18.620
My snail's really got Squidward
scared, huh, SpongeBob?
我的蜗牛真的中了章鱼哥
害怕吧，海绵宝宝？

05:18.724 --> 05:19.862
Sorry, Patrick.
对不起，帕特里克。

05:19.965 --> 05:21.758
Gary and I've got
some serious work to do.
加里和我有
一些严肃的工作要做。

05:21.862 --> 05:25.275
You can run, but you can't hide,
Squarepants!
你可以逃跑，但你无法隐藏
方裤！

05:25.379 --> 05:27.758
All right, Gary,
no more fooling around.
好吧，加里，
别再胡闹了。

05:27.862 --> 05:29.517
Time to get serious.
是时候认真起来了。

05:30.758 --> 05:32.344
Come on, Gary, move it!
来吧，加里，动起来！

05:32.448 --> 05:34.689
Up, up, up, up!
Down, down, down, down!
起来，起来，起​​来，起​​来！
下来，下来，下来，下来！

05:34.793 --> 05:36.793
Faster, faster, faster!
Go, go, go!
更快，更快，更快！
去！去！去！

05:36.896 --> 05:38.551
Come on, push it, Gary, push it!
来吧，推吧，加里，推吧！

05:38.655 --> 05:39.793
Move that shell!
移动那个壳！

05:39.896 --> 05:41.344
Come on, Gary, move it!
来吧，加里，动起来！

05:41.448 --> 05:43.241
Let's go! Let's go!
Let's go! Faster!
我们走吧！我们走吧！
我们走吧！快点！

05:43.344 --> 05:46.000
Let's go! Let's go!
Speed it up! Speed it up!
我们走吧！我们走吧！
加快速度！加快速度！

05:46.103 --> 05:47.758
Move it, Gary!
Move it, move it, move it!
移动它，加里！
动起来，动起来，动起来！

05:47.862 --> 05:49.965
Stroke, stroke, stroke.
中风，中风，中风。

05:50.068 --> 05:51.965
Come on, Gary,
we're going to be late
来吧，加里，
我们要迟到了

05:52.068 --> 05:54.068
for the big race!
为了大赛！

05:54.172 --> 05:55.965
Good afternoon,
ladies and gentlemen
下午好，
女士们先生们

05:56.068 --> 05:57.758
and welcome to our live coverage
欢迎收看我们的现场报道

05:57.862 --> 06:00.413
of this year's spring classic,
the 102nd Running of The Snail.
今年的春季经典，
第102次蜗牛奔跑。

06:00.517 --> 06:02.965
And what a beautiful day
for this sport of kings
多么美好的一天
为了这项国王的运动

06:03.068 --> 06:04.482
of which I'm a huge fan.
我是其中的超级粉丝。

06:04.586 --> 06:05.931
Seriously, I'm just a fan.
说实话，我只是一个粉丝。

06:06.034 --> 06:08.275
I was on my way to my seat,
the door was open...
我正在走向座位的路上，
门是开着的……

06:08.379 --> 06:09.827
Hey, what are you doing?!
嘿，你在做什么？

06:11.793 --> 06:12.827
Sorry about that, folks.
抱歉，伙计们。

06:12.931 --> 06:14.310
Let's go down to the field
我们到田野去吧

06:14.413 --> 06:16.896
to join the mayor
for the pre-game ceremony.
加入市长
进行赛前仪式。

06:17.000 --> 06:22.827
And now for the lighting of the
Torch of Good Sportsmanship.
现在是照明
良好体育精神的火炬。

06:22.931 --> 06:24.344
Please join me
请加入我

06:24.448 --> 06:28.931
in welcoming snail racing's
first-ever champion
在欢迎蜗牛赛跑的
有史以来第一个冠军

06:29.034 --> 06:31.034
Lightning Larry Luciano!
闪电拉里卢西亚诺！

06:33.034 --> 06:35.896
Would you look at that, folks?
各位，你们会看一下吗？

06:36.000 --> 06:38.862
Lightning Larry Luciano,
a living legend
闪电拉里·卢西亚诺，
一个活生生的传奇

06:38.965 --> 06:41.931
slowly making his way
center stage.
慢慢地走他的路
舞台中央。

06:42.034 --> 06:46.310
And what a proud moment
for this sport.
这是多么值得骄傲的时刻
对于这项运动。

06:46.413 --> 06:50.344
The crowd is going
absolutely nuts...
人群正在走
绝对疯了...

06:50.448 --> 06:51.965
for Larry.
对于拉里.

06:52.068 --> 06:54.482
He's almost there.
他快到了。

06:56.482 --> 06:57.931
Uh, yes, siree.
呃，是的，长官。

06:58.034 --> 07:01.000
Any minute now.
现在随时都可以。

07:02.620 --> 07:05.655
He's almost a quarter
of the way there.
他快四分之一了
那里的路。

07:13.965 --> 07:15.000
The torch is lit!
火炬点燃了！

07:15.103 --> 07:16.103
Let the race begin.
让比赛开始吧。

07:18.379 --> 07:20.137
Well, SpongeBob, I must admit
好吧，海绵宝宝，我必须承认

07:20.241 --> 07:22.931
I didn't think
that mongrel mutt of yours
我没想到
你那只杂种狗

07:23.034 --> 07:25.034
would even find
the starting line.
甚至会发现
起跑线。

07:25.137 --> 07:26.586
Congratulations.
恭喜。

07:28.482 --> 07:30.448
Save it for the loser's circle,
Squidward.
留到失败者的圈子里，
章鱼哥。

07:30.551 --> 07:33.137
Gary happens to be
in the best shape of his life.
加里恰好是
处于他一生中最好的状态。

07:37.034 --> 07:38.965
I'll alert the paramedics.
我会通知医护人员。

07:39.068 --> 07:41.137
Good one, Squidward.
好一个，章鱼哥。

07:41.241 --> 07:42.448
You guys ready?
你们准备好了吗？

07:42.551 --> 07:43.379
Uh! A burglar!
呃！一个窃贼！

07:43.482 --> 07:45.758
No, Patrick,
that's the official.
不，帕特里克，
那是官员。

07:45.862 --> 07:47.620
We're ready to start
here, folks.
我们准备开始了
在这里，伙计们。

07:47.724 --> 07:49.620
Okay, Snellie, let's show these
好的，斯内利，让我们展示这些

07:49.724 --> 07:51.413
common, garden-variety snails
常见的花园蜗牛

07:51.517 --> 07:54.000
what superior breeding
is all about.
什么优良育种
就是这样。

07:55.275 --> 07:56.827
All right, Gary, listen up.
好吧，加里，听着。

07:56.931 --> 07:58.896
The competition is
going to be fierce.
比赛是
会很激烈。

07:59.000 --> 08:00.103
You're the undersnail.
你就是那只下蜗牛。

08:00.206 --> 08:02.103
Everybody's already
counting you out.
大家都已经
算你了。

08:02.206 --> 08:03.482
Now get out there and win
现在走出去并赢得胜利

08:03.586 --> 08:05.965
so we can rub Squidward's
big, fat nose in it.
所以我们可以擦章鱼哥的
又大又胖的鼻子在里面。

08:07.379 --> 08:09.586
This is what you've been
training for, Rocky.
这就是你曾经的样子
训练，洛基。

08:09.689 --> 08:11.206
This is why we're here.
这就是我们在这里的原因。

08:11.310 --> 08:13.586
On your mark, get set
各就各位，准备就绪

08:13.689 --> 08:14.689
slither!
滑行！

08:14.758 --> 08:16.689
And they're off!
他们走了！

08:16.793 --> 08:19.344
Number six, Snellie, rockets out
of the starting blocks
第六名，斯内利，火箭出局
起跑器

08:19.448 --> 08:21.793
leaving the other two
competitors in the dust!
留下另外两个
尘埃中的竞争对手！

08:21.896 --> 08:22.896
What?
什么？

08:23.000 --> 08:24.344
Go, Snellie, you got it, baby!
去吧，斯内利，你做到了，宝贝！

08:24.448 --> 08:27.448
What are you doing, Gary?!
The race has started!
你在做什么，加里？
比赛开始了！

08:27.551 --> 08:30.068
You let Snellie take the lead!
你让斯内利带头！

08:31.206 --> 08:33.310
Let's go, Gary!
Start moving!
我们走吧，加里！
开始行动吧！

08:33.413 --> 08:36.827
You're blowing everything
we trained for!
你毁了一切
我们训练的目的！

08:36.931 --> 08:38.241
Blowing it!
吹了！

08:38.344 --> 08:41.034
It's okay, Rocky.
You go when you feel like it.
没关系，洛基。
当你想走的时候你就走。

08:41.137 --> 08:44.068
Gary, are you listening to me?!
加里，你在听我说话吗？

08:44.172 --> 08:46.724
Get the anchors out
of your pants right now!
把锚拿出来
现在就脱掉你的裤子！

08:46.827 --> 08:48.172
Don't give me that look!
别用那种眼神看我！

08:48.275 --> 08:52.482
I said now, mister!
Get going, Gary!
我说现在，先生！
走吧，加里！

08:52.586 --> 08:54.275
Go, go, go, go!
走，走，走，走！

08:54.379 --> 08:57.655
And there goes number seven
out of the starting gate.
还有第七个
出了起跑门。

08:57.758 --> 08:58.827
Hang on, folks.
坚持住，伙计们。

08:58.931 --> 09:02.241
He doesn't look so good.
他看起来不太好。

09:02.344 --> 09:05.862
Not good enough, Gary!
Not good enough! Faster!
还不够好，加里！
还不够好！快点！

09:09.310 --> 09:11.379
I do not like the look of this.
我不喜欢这个样子。

09:11.482 --> 09:14.068
Come on, Gary, it's a race!
A race!
来吧，加里，这是一场比赛！
一场比赛！

09:14.172 --> 09:16.379
Have you heard of 'em?!
你听说过他们吗？

09:16.482 --> 09:19.241
That coach is pushing that snail
too hard.
那个教练正在推那只蜗牛
太难了。

09:19.344 --> 09:22.137
Faster, Gary! Faster, faster,
faster, faster!
快点，加里！更快，更快，
更快，更快！

09:24.103 --> 09:25.413
Huh?
啊？

09:25.517 --> 09:27.448
Oh! Looks like number seven
has a blowout.
哦！看起来像七号
有井喷。

09:31.172 --> 09:32.862
Oop, make that two, folks.
哦，伙计们，做两个吧。

09:35.689 --> 09:36.689
Uh, Gary?
呃，加里？

09:39.896 --> 09:42.586
Plus a blown head gasket!
加上一个吹掉的头部垫圈！

09:42.689 --> 09:45.000
Oh, and the poor creature's
still going for it.
哦，还有这个可怜的生物
仍在努力。

09:45.103 --> 09:48.034
Um, Gary, you can stop now.
嗯，加里，你现在可以停下来了。

09:48.137 --> 09:50.034
And he's losing control!
而且他正在失去控制！

09:56.896 --> 09:59.931
You can take a breath now
if you want to, Gary!
你现在可以喘口气了
如果你愿意的话，加里！

10:00.034 --> 10:01.965
He's spinning out of control!
他正在失控地旋转！

10:02.068 --> 10:04.793
He's heading straight
for the wall!
他径直前进
为了墙！

10:13.172 --> 10:15.206
No!
不！

10:18.000 --> 10:20.896
Hold on, Gary, I'm coming!
加里，坚持住，我来了！

10:21.000 --> 10:22.448
Whoa-oa.
哇哦。

10:22.551 --> 10:25.482
One of the coaches seems
to have raced onto the track.
其中一位教练似乎
已经跑上赛道了。

10:25.586 --> 10:27.862
That is an automatic
disqualification.
那是一个自动
取消资格。

10:27.965 --> 10:30.758
Looks like number six
has this race all wrapped up,
看起来像六号
这场比赛已经结束了吗

10:30.862 --> 10:32.068
ladies and gentlemen.
女士们，先生们。

10:32.172 --> 10:35.241
Come on, Snellie,
it's all you, baby!
来吧，斯内利，
都是你，宝贝！

10:35.344 --> 10:36.793
Oh, Gary, I'm sorry.
哦，加里，对不起。

10:36.896 --> 10:40.137
Why didn't you just say
I was pushing it too hard?
你刚才为什么不说
是我逼得太紧了吗？

10:41.551 --> 10:42.724
You did?
你做到了吗？

10:42.827 --> 10:45.000
Oh, Gary, why didn't you tell me
I wasn't listening?!
哦，加里，你为什么不告诉我
我没听？！

10:46.413 --> 10:47.137
You did?
你做到了吗？

10:47.241 --> 10:51.413
Oh, Gary!
Oh, Gary!
哦，加里！
哦，加里！

10:52.724 --> 10:54.137
What?!
什么？！

10:56.103 --> 10:57.793
Gary?
加里？

11:01.586 --> 11:03.241
Oh...
哦...

11:03.344 --> 11:05.758
Aw...
噢...

11:07.206 --> 11:08.448
My, oh, my.
我的，哦，我的。

11:08.551 --> 11:12.413
Folks, I have never seen
anything quite like this.
各位，我从未见过
类似这样的事情。

11:12.517 --> 11:16.655
It seems Snellie, the leader,
just went back to comfort Gary.
看来领导者斯内利，
刚刚回去安慰加里。

11:16.758 --> 11:20.379
Looks like you and I are
in-laws, eh, Squidward?
看起来你和我都是
姻亲，呃，章鱼哥？

11:20.482 --> 11:22.137
But that's impossible.
但这是不可能的。

11:22.241 --> 11:24.103
If Snellie didn't win, then...
如果斯内利没有获胜，那么……

11:24.206 --> 11:27.137
And the winner is Rocky!
获胜者是洛基！

11:34.172 --> 11:36.000
I can't believe it.
我简直不敢相信。

11:36.103 --> 11:39.241
My purebred...
Which cost me $1,700...
我的纯种...
这花了我 1,700 美元...

11:39.344 --> 11:41.275
Lost to a rock.
迷失在一块岩石上。

11:41.379 --> 11:43.068
Don't worry, Squidward.
别担心，章鱼哥。

11:43.172 --> 11:45.206
I know how much
you wanted to win
我知道多少
你想赢

11:45.310 --> 11:47.931
so I had the trophy
engraved to you.
所以我得到了奖杯
刻给你。

11:48.034 --> 11:49.137
Gosh, Patrick, thanks.
天哪，帕特里克，谢谢。

11:49.241 --> 11:52.172
"The 1st Place Snail Racing Cup
《蜗牛赛跑杯》第一名

11:52.275 --> 11:55.793
Presented to
Squidward Tortellini?"
提交给
鱿鱼饺子？”

11:55.896 --> 11:58.931
Will I ever win?
我会赢吗？

12:02.344 --> 12:04.586
That's for yesterday,
Squarepants!
这是昨天的事
方裤！

12:16.413 --> 12:19.275
You've got it tuned to KOLD...
您已将其调至 KOLD...

12:19.379 --> 12:21.000
K-OLD, the all oldies station.
K-OLD，所有老歌电台。

12:21.103 --> 12:22.310
Here's a little something
这里有一点东西

12:22.413 --> 12:25.931
you may remember
from the good old days.
你可能还记得
从过去的美好时光。

12:26.034 --> 12:28.068
♪ You're old
♪ 你老了

12:28.172 --> 12:30.206
♪ You're old ♪
♪ 你老了 ♪

12:31.482 --> 12:33.172
♪ Grumbling like a geezer
♪ 像个老头一样抱怨

12:36.862 --> 12:42.379
♪ Yourself a-cracklin'
like an old has-been ♪
♪ 你自己噼啪作响
就像过去一样 ♪

12:42.482 --> 12:47.482
♪ Look at yourself, old man,
you've got multiple chins ♪
♪ 看看你自己，老人，
你有多个下巴♪

12:47.586 --> 12:51.724
♪ 'Cause you're old...
♪ 因为你老了...

12:54.448 --> 12:57.103
Good morning, Daddy.
早上好，爸爸。

12:57.206 --> 12:58.413
I made you breakfast.
我给你做了早餐。

12:58.517 --> 13:00.862
Thank you, sweet pea.
谢谢你，甜豌豆。

13:00.965 --> 13:03.586
I see you got creative
with the bran today.
我发现你很有创意
今天用麸皮。

13:03.689 --> 13:07.586
Open up. It's time
for the pill.
打开。是时候了
为了药丸。

13:07.689 --> 13:08.689
Oh, Barnacles.
哦，藤壶。

13:08.724 --> 13:10.827
I hate the pill.
我讨厌药丸。

13:14.275 --> 13:15.379
Ooh...
哦...

13:15.482 --> 13:19.000
Pearl... do you think
I'm... old?
珍珠……你觉得
我……老了？

13:19.103 --> 13:21.034
Well, of course I do!
嗯，我当然愿意！

13:21.137 --> 13:22.241
But that's okay.
但没关系。

13:22.344 --> 13:24.482
Daddies are supposed to be old.
爸爸们应该都老了。

13:24.586 --> 13:27.275
But I'm still cool, right?
但我还是很酷，对吧？

13:27.379 --> 13:29.344
Your old man is cool?
你老头子帅吗？

13:29.448 --> 13:32.344
See, no one says "cool" anymore.
瞧，没有人再说“酷”了。

13:32.448 --> 13:34.172
That's such an old-person thing.
这真是一个老人家的事了。

13:34.275 --> 13:36.827
Now we say "coral," as in
现在我们说“珊瑚”，如

13:36.931 --> 13:39.689
"That nose job is so coral."
“那个鼻子整形手术太珊瑚了。”

13:39.793 --> 13:41.241
"Coral," eh?
“珊瑚”，嗯？

13:41.344 --> 13:45.724
Ew. When you say it,
it sounds so uncoral.
呃。当你说出来的时候，
听起来很不道德。

13:45.827 --> 13:48.586
What if I said it
with a different inflection?
如果我说了怎么办
有不同的变化？

13:48.689 --> 13:50.655
Co-ral.
珊瑚。

13:50.758 --> 13:53.724
Don't you have to go
to work or something, Dad?
你不必走吗
爸爸，去工作还是做什么？

13:53.827 --> 13:55.448
Whoo! You're right.
呼！你说得对。

13:55.551 --> 13:58.379
Have a coral day, honey.
亲爱的，度过珊瑚日。

14:00.379 --> 14:01.517
Jenny, it's Pearl.
珍妮，这是珀尔。

14:01.620 --> 14:04.551
Coral is definitely out.
珊瑚肯定已经出局了。

14:04.655 --> 14:08.344
Ha! Old?!
哈!老的？！

14:08.448 --> 14:10.241
What was I thinking?
我在想什么？

14:10.344 --> 14:12.344
I ain't old. Huh?
我还没老啊？

14:12.448 --> 14:13.482
Don't worry, Pops.
别担心，爸爸。

14:13.586 --> 14:15.000
We're almost across the street.
我们快到街对面了。

14:15.103 --> 14:16.448
Hey, get away from me.
嘿，离我远点。

14:16.551 --> 14:19.551
I don't need no
snot-nosed little...
我不需要 没有
流鼻涕的小...

14:19.655 --> 14:21.689
sorry you had to see that.
抱歉你不得不看到这一点。

14:24.448 --> 14:28.241
Come on. Move it!
快点。移动它！

14:28.344 --> 14:31.172
Could you be any slower?
你能慢点吗？

14:31.275 --> 14:33.344
And you've had your blinker on
你已经打开了你的闪光灯

14:33.448 --> 14:36.482
for the last five blocks.
最后五个街区。

14:41.551 --> 14:42.965
Hey, Mister, could you
嘿，先生，你可以吗？

14:43.068 --> 14:44.517
throw the ball back over here?
把球扔回这里？

14:44.620 --> 14:47.482
Hey, how's about
I join you kids?
嘿，怎么样
孩子们，我加入你们吗？

14:48.827 --> 14:50.344
Uh... that's okay.
呃……没关系。

14:50.448 --> 14:51.827
You can keep it.
你可以保留它。

14:51.931 --> 14:54.413
Why do old people always
have to ruin the fun?
为什么老人总是
一定要破坏乐趣吗？

15:00.206 --> 15:02.068
Hey! No cutting!
嘿！不准切割！

15:02.172 --> 15:05.517
You got to wait your
turn like everybody else.
你必须等待你的
像其他人一样转动。

15:06.482 --> 15:09.724
No... no!
I ain't old like you!
不……不！
我没你那么老！

15:09.827 --> 15:11.275
I ain't old!
我还没老啊！

15:11.379 --> 15:14.103
I ain't old!
我还没老啊！

15:14.206 --> 15:16.241
What's his problem?
他有什么问题吗？

15:16.344 --> 15:18.931
Next.
下一个。

15:20.517 --> 15:23.034
Mommy, my Krabby patty
tastes funny.
妈妈，我的蟹黄饼
味道很有趣。

15:23.137 --> 15:24.724
Well, no wonder.
嗯，这也不足为奇。

15:24.827 --> 15:26.586
It's all old and dried out...
一切都又旧又干了...

15:26.689 --> 15:28.482
like that man right there.
就像那里的那个人。

15:29.517 --> 15:31.379
Now, put that thing
where it belongs...
现在，把那个东西
它属于哪里...

15:31.482 --> 15:32.620
In the garbage.
在垃圾里。

15:32.724 --> 15:34.344
♪ La-la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦♪

15:34.448 --> 15:36.551
♪ La-la-la-la-la,
la-la-la-la... ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦啦，
啦啦啦啦……♪

15:36.655 --> 15:40.448
Well, little patty,
we're two of a kind.
嗯，小帕蒂，
我们是两个同类。

15:40.551 --> 15:44.206
We've both lost our luster.
我们都失去了光彩。

15:44.310 --> 15:46.310
Hmm. So that's
what I taste like.
唔。所以那就是
我的味道怎么样。

15:46.413 --> 15:48.241
Good morning, Krusty Crew.
早上好，克鲁斯蒂·船员。

15:48.344 --> 15:52.862
Hi, Patrick! You all ready
for the big night out tonight?
嗨，帕特里克！你们都准备好了
今晚的盛大夜晚？

15:52.965 --> 15:54.448
Yeah, it's gonna rock!
是的，它会摇滚！

15:54.551 --> 15:56.586
Are you ready to go crazy?!
你准备好疯狂了吗？！

15:56.689 --> 15:58.448
I'm already hearing voices!
我已经听到声音了！

15:58.551 --> 16:00.137
Are you ready to...
你准备好了吗...

16:00.241 --> 16:03.517
SpongeBob! Patrick!
Do you mind?
海绵宝宝！帕特里克！
你介意吗？

16:03.620 --> 16:06.827
Let's continue
this conversation
in private, Patrick.
让我们继续
这次谈话
私下里，帕特里克。

16:06.931 --> 16:10.137
I think some people
are eavesdropping!
我认为有些人
正在窃听！

16:10.241 --> 16:12.413
Well, how rude of some people!
唉，有些人真是粗鲁啊！

16:12.517 --> 16:15.448
Mmm. Those youngsters
are going out
嗯。那些年轻人
正在外出

16:15.551 --> 16:17.655
for a big night on the town.
在城里度过一个美好的夜晚。

16:17.758 --> 16:21.310
Whoo! I've been looking
forward to this night all week.
呼！我一直在寻找
整个星期都期待着这个晚上。

16:21.413 --> 16:22.551
Party!
派对！

16:22.655 --> 16:24.551
What do you think
we should do first?
你觉得怎么样
我们应该先做什么？

16:24.655 --> 16:26.551
What shouldn't we do first?
我们首先不应该做什么？

16:26.655 --> 16:28.379
We're young...
我们还年轻...

16:28.482 --> 16:30.241
we've got wheels...
我们有轮子...

16:30.344 --> 16:31.620
the world is our oyster!
世界是我们的牡蛎！

16:31.724 --> 16:34.344
SpongeBob, you got something
on your shoulder.
海绵宝宝，你有东西
在你的肩膀上。

16:34.448 --> 16:37.172
Hey, boys.
Hanging out?
嘿，孩子们。
出去玩？

16:37.275 --> 16:38.103
Yes.
是的。

16:38.206 --> 16:39.482
I couldn't help
我无能为力

16:39.586 --> 16:42.758
overhearing your big plans,
and I was wondering
无意中听到你的大计划
我想知道

16:42.862 --> 16:46.517
if you had room for one more
crazy dude tonight, huh?
如果你还有空间再容纳一位
今晚这个家伙很疯狂吧？

16:46.620 --> 16:50.310
Of course. Did you want
to come with us, Mr. Krabs?
当然。你想要吗
跟我们一起去吗，蟹老板？

16:50.413 --> 16:52.379
Oh... hadn't even
crossed me mind.
哦...甚至没有
我突然想到。

16:52.482 --> 16:53.620
But sure! I'll go!
但当然！我去！

16:53.724 --> 16:55.586
I don't know, SpongeBob.
我不知道，海绵宝宝。

16:55.689 --> 16:57.827
He might cramp our style.
他可能会限制我们的风格。

16:57.931 --> 16:59.206
Style!
风格！

16:59.310 --> 17:00.758
Let's see if he knows
让我们看看他是否知道

17:00.862 --> 17:03.275
the secret cool-guy handshake.
秘密的酷人握手。

17:03.379 --> 17:04.379
Uh... yeah!
呃……是啊！

17:04.482 --> 17:05.482
'Course I know it.
我当然知道。

17:05.586 --> 17:07.068
Uh...
呃...

17:08.068 --> 17:09.482
Uh...
呃...

17:09.586 --> 17:12.551
I'm waiting... old man.
我在等……老头子。

17:12.655 --> 17:15.000
Uh... how do you do?
呃……你怎么样？

17:15.103 --> 17:17.448
Fine, and you?
All right, you're in.
很好，你呢？
好吧，你进来了。

17:17.551 --> 17:18.896
But I'm not happy about it.
但我对此并不高兴。

17:19.000 --> 17:21.241
You passed the test,
Mr. Krabs!
你通过了测试，
蟹老板！

17:21.344 --> 17:25.344
Great! Why don't you boys
show up at my house at 8:00.
伟大的！为什么你们男孩不
8:00 出现在我家。

17:25.448 --> 17:27.586
I just want to warn you,
Mr. Krabs
我只是想警告你，
蟹老板先生

17:27.689 --> 17:28.889
we're always fashionably late.
我们总是时髦地迟到。

17:32.655 --> 17:34.793
Hey, there, Mr. Krabs.
嘿，在那儿，蟹老板。

17:34.896 --> 17:36.586
Are you ready to party!
你准备好参加派对了吗！

17:36.689 --> 17:38.517
Oh, I'm ready to party!
哦，我准备好参加聚会了！

17:38.620 --> 17:39.620
Are you ready to party?
你准备好参加派对了吗？

17:39.689 --> 17:40.758
I'm ready to party!
我准备好参加派对了！

17:40.862 --> 17:42.551
Are you ready to party,
SpongeBob?
你准备好参加派对了吗
海绵宝宝？

17:42.655 --> 17:43.758
I'm ready to party!
我准备好参加派对了！

17:43.862 --> 17:45.586
Are you ready to party,
Mr. Krabs?
你准备好参加派对了吗
蟹老板？

17:45.689 --> 17:47.068
I'm ready to par-tay!
我准备好参加派对了！

17:47.172 --> 17:49.068
Are you ready
to par-tay, SpongeBob!
你准备好了吗
来派对吧，海绵宝宝！

17:49.172 --> 17:50.206
I'm ready to par-tay!
我准备好参加派对了！

17:50.310 --> 17:51.630
Are you ready to par-tay,
Patrick?
你准备好参加派对了吗
帕特里克？

17:51.655 --> 17:52.758
I'm ready to party!
我准备好参加派对了！

17:52.862 --> 17:54.551
Are you ready to party,
Mr. Krabs?
你准备好参加派对了吗
蟹老板？

17:54.655 --> 17:56.448
I'm ready to party!
我准备好参加派对了！

17:56.551 --> 17:57.551
Are you ready to...
你准备好了吗...

17:57.655 --> 17:59.586
Stop it!
Just stop it.
停下来！
停下来吧。

17:59.689 --> 18:02.793
You're embarrassing me, Dad.
你让我很尴尬，爸爸。

18:02.896 --> 18:07.103
So... what kind of hot rod
will we be cruisin' in tonight?
那么...什么样的热棒
今晚我们会巡航吗？

18:07.206 --> 18:09.931
Only the most powerful
chick-magnet in town...
只有最强大的
镇上的小鸡磁铁...

18:10.034 --> 18:12.068
the underwater heartbreaker.
水下的心碎者。

18:12.172 --> 18:14.827
It's more like
a chick repellent.
它更像是
一种小鸡驱避剂。

18:14.931 --> 18:17.275
And there's only two seats.
而且只有两个座位。

18:17.379 --> 18:19.103
Calm your waters,
Mr. Krabs.
平静你的水面，
蟹老板。

18:19.206 --> 18:22.068
I modified this little
baby myself.
我修改了这个小
宝贝我自己。

18:23.931 --> 18:26.793
Are you sure this is what
the kids are driving these days?
你确定这是什么吗
这些天孩子们开车吗？

18:26.896 --> 18:29.206
Only the cool kids.
只有酷孩子。

18:30.758 --> 18:32.724
Hey. You guys
must be lost.
嘿。你们
一定会丢失。

18:32.827 --> 18:35.344
Doofus Drive
is around the corner.
杜福斯大道
即将到来。

18:35.448 --> 18:36.620
We're not lost.
我们没有迷路。

18:36.724 --> 18:38.413
I've got my compass.
我有我的指南针。

18:38.517 --> 18:41.172
So long, dorks!
Ha-ha!
再见，傻瓜们！
哈哈！

18:41.275 --> 18:42.724
Good-bye, pals.
再见，朋友们。

18:42.827 --> 18:45.827
We used to beat people up
for saying things like that!
我们曾经打过人
说出这样的话！

18:45.931 --> 18:48.206
Everything's
all topsy-turvy now.
一切的
现在一切都乱七八糟了。

18:48.310 --> 18:50.931
Here we are...
我们在这里...

18:51.034 --> 18:52.137
The Wash.
洗涤。

18:52.241 --> 18:54.827
They sure are giving these clubs
some crazy names.
他们肯定会给这些俱乐部
一些疯狂的名字。

18:54.931 --> 18:57.655
I have to tell you boys...
我必须告诉你们男孩们...

18:57.758 --> 18:58.965
I'm a little nervous.
我有点紧张。

18:59.068 --> 19:02.793
I haven't been, you know,
"on the scene"
我没去过，你知道，
“在现场”

19:02.896 --> 19:04.655
for quite a while now.
已经有一段时间了。

19:04.758 --> 19:07.000
Just follow our
lead, Mr. Krabs.
只需关注我们的
领导，蟹老板先生。

19:07.103 --> 19:09.379
And above all...
keep it cool.
最重要的是...
保持凉爽。

19:09.482 --> 19:11.103
Cool... Gotcha.
酷...明白了。

19:17.724 --> 19:20.517
Hello, gang.
SpongeBob's back.
你好，帮派。
海绵宝宝回来了。

19:20.620 --> 19:22.517
Let's party!
让我们一起狂欢吧！

19:22.620 --> 19:24.551
Any port in a stor...
商店中的任何端口...

19:24.655 --> 19:26.068
Wait a minute.
等一下。

19:27.275 --> 19:29.655
This is a Laundromat.
这是一家自助洗衣店。

19:29.758 --> 19:31.896
Oh, yeah! Whoo!
哦，是啊！呼！

19:32.000 --> 19:34.172
That's what I'm talking about.
这就是我要说的。

19:34.275 --> 19:36.034
Oh, yeah, yeah!
哦，是啊，是啊！

19:36.137 --> 19:37.137
The colors!
颜色！

19:37.241 --> 19:39.620
Whoa, yeah!
哇，是啊！

19:39.724 --> 19:42.068
You guys want another
rinse cycle? I'm buying.
你们想要另一个
冲洗周期？我正在买。

19:42.172 --> 19:44.724
You know, I love staring
at delicates
你知道，我喜欢凝视
在熟食店

19:44.827 --> 19:46.896
as much as the next guy, but...
和下一个人一样多，但是......

19:47.000 --> 19:49.724
it's just that, I thought
we'd see more of the nightlife.
就是这样，我想
我们会看到更多的夜生活。

19:49.827 --> 19:51.068
Something that will give me
能给我的东西

19:51.172 --> 19:54.413
that wild and crazy,
hot-blooded feeling...
那样的狂野和疯狂，
热血的感觉...

19:54.517 --> 19:55.655
if you know what I mean.
如果你明白我的意思。

19:55.758 --> 19:59.137
Oh, I know what you mean,
Mr. Krabs.
哦，我知道你的意思，
蟹老板。

19:59.241 --> 20:03.551
This is only stop numero uno
on our night of debauchery!
这只是停止 numero uno
在我们放荡的夜晚！

20:03.655 --> 20:05.103
Debauchery!
放荡！

20:05.206 --> 20:06.206
Debauchery!
放荡！

20:08.689 --> 20:11.068
Debauchery? I never thought
放荡？我从没想过

20:11.172 --> 20:13.896
of picking up trash under
the highway as hot-blooded.
捡拾下面的垃圾
高速公路同样热血沸腾。

20:14.000 --> 20:16.482
But if it's what the kids
are into...
但如果这就是孩子们的事
进入...

20:16.586 --> 20:17.827
So are you feeling
你也有这样的感觉吗

20:17.931 --> 20:20.000
that wild and crazy
feeling, Mr. Krabs?
那样狂野和疯狂
蟹老板，感觉怎么样？

20:20.103 --> 20:21.344
Not yet.
还没有。

20:21.448 --> 20:22.862
Don't worry, you will.
别担心，你会的。

20:22.965 --> 20:25.586
Are you feeling it
now, Mr. Krabs?
你有感觉吗
现在，蟹老板？

20:25.689 --> 20:27.137
I'm feeling a warm spot.
我感觉有一个温暖的地方。

20:27.241 --> 20:28.241
Sorry.
对不起。

20:28.310 --> 20:29.310
Are you feeling it now
你现在有感觉吗

20:29.413 --> 20:30.413
Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板？

20:30.448 --> 20:31.448
Are you feeling it?
你感觉到了吗？

20:31.482 --> 20:33.172
I'm feeling it, SpongeBob.
我感觉到了，海绵宝宝。

20:33.275 --> 20:35.344
Patrick, that's not a ride.
帕特里克，那不是搭车。

20:35.448 --> 20:38.103
Get off of me.
离开我。

20:38.206 --> 20:39.965
Are you feeling it now,
Mr. Krabs?
现在你有感觉吗
蟹老板？

20:40.068 --> 20:42.103
Are you feeling
it now, Mr. Krabs?
你有没有感觉
现在就可以了吗，蟹老板先生？

20:42.206 --> 20:45.517
Art thou feeling it now,
Mr. Krabs?
你现在感觉到了吗，
蟹老板？

20:45.620 --> 20:47.827
You feeling it now,
Mr. Krabs?
你现在感觉到了，
蟹老板？

20:47.931 --> 20:49.137
Shh!
嘘！

20:49.241 --> 20:51.000
How about now?
Can you feel it, Mr. Krabs?
现在怎么样？
蟹老板，你能感觉到吗？

20:51.103 --> 20:53.586
Can you feel it,
Mr. Krabs?
你能感觉到吗，
蟹老板？

20:53.689 --> 20:55.344
Can you feel it, Mr. Krabs?
蟹老板，你能感觉到吗？

20:55.448 --> 20:56.827
Can you feel it,
Mr. Krabs?
你能感觉到吗，
蟹老板？

20:56.931 --> 21:00.034
So, you want to know
if I can feelit?
所以，你想知道
如果我能感觉到吗？

21:00.137 --> 21:01.413
Yeah! Yeah!
是的！是的！

21:01.517 --> 21:04.793
Do you really want to know
if I can feelit?
你真的想知道吗
如果我能感觉到吗？

21:04.896 --> 21:06.482
Yeah, yeah! Yeah, yeah!
是啊是啊！是啊是啊！

21:06.586 --> 21:08.758
Because I can feelit.
因为我能感觉到。

21:08.862 --> 21:10.724
You want to know what
I'm feeling?
你想知道什么
我感觉？

21:10.827 --> 21:12.068
Yes! Yes!
是的！是的！

21:12.172 --> 21:16.344
I'm feeling like
a total barnacle-head!
我感觉就像
一个十足的藤壶头！

21:20.551 --> 21:22.206
You think this is cool?!
你觉得这很酷吗？

21:22.310 --> 21:23.482
How about this!
这个怎么样！

21:23.586 --> 21:26.655
And this! Am I with it now?
还有这个！我现在同意了吗？

21:26.758 --> 21:28.413
You guys wouldn't
know a good time
你们不会
知道好时光

21:28.517 --> 21:29.827
if it bit you in the aft end!
如果它在尾部咬了你！

21:29.931 --> 21:31.379
I'm going home.
我要回家了。

21:31.482 --> 21:32.620
You guys ain't cool.
你们不酷。

21:32.724 --> 21:34.310
You're lame!
你太蹩脚了！

21:34.413 --> 21:36.310
Uh... lame?!
呃……蹩脚？！

21:36.413 --> 21:37.689
Lame!
瘸！

21:37.793 --> 21:39.275
You're nerds! Geeks
你们是书呆子！极客

21:39.379 --> 21:41.551
Creeps! And babies!
令人毛骨悚然！还有宝贝们！

21:41.655 --> 21:44.896
Not babies!
Not babies!
不是婴儿！
不是婴儿！

21:45.000 --> 21:47.896
I may be old, but even
an old bag of shells like me
我可能老了，但即使
像我一样的旧贝壳袋

21:48.000 --> 21:51.655
knows that you haven't suggested
one cool thing all night!
知道你没有建议
整个晚上一件很酷的事情！

21:51.758 --> 21:53.068
So good night to ya!
祝你晚安！

21:53.172 --> 21:56.517
I guess you're going to miss
the panty raid.
我猜你会错过
内裤袭击。

21:56.620 --> 21:57.620
The what?
什么？

21:57.724 --> 22:00.724
I said... I guess you're going
我说...我猜你会去

22:00.827 --> 22:03.172
to miss the panty raid.
错过内裤袭击。

22:03.275 --> 22:08.551
Panty raid? You're talking
about girls, right?
内裤袭击？你在说话
关于女孩，对吗？

22:08.655 --> 22:10.137
Girl girls?
女孩女孩？

22:10.241 --> 22:11.413
Yeah.
是的。

22:11.517 --> 22:14.586
And you're talking
about raiding their dressers
而你正在说话
关于袭击他们的梳妆台

22:14.689 --> 22:16.310
for their underpants, right?
为了他们的内裤，对吗？

22:16.413 --> 22:18.448
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

22:18.551 --> 22:20.862
Well, count me in!
好吧，算我一个吧！

22:20.965 --> 22:23.344
If this works, I'll take
back what I said
如果这有效，我会采取
回复我说的话

22:23.448 --> 22:24.827
about you two being lame.
关于你们两个瘸子的事。

22:24.931 --> 22:26.724
Not lame!
不蹩脚！

22:26.827 --> 22:29.448
Now, this is more like it!
现在，这更像了！

22:29.551 --> 22:31.965
Give us some credit, old man.
老伙计，请给我们一些信任。

22:32.068 --> 22:34.517
We're panty professionals!
我们是内裤专家！

22:34.620 --> 22:37.586
We score here all the time.
我们一直在这里得分。

22:42.758 --> 22:44.517
Frilly things!
褶边的东西！

22:44.620 --> 22:46.689
We hit the jackpot!
我们中大奖了！

22:46.793 --> 22:48.448
Oh, yeah,
Mr. Krabs!
哦，是的，
蟹老板！

22:48.551 --> 22:49.793
Woo-hoo!
呜呼！

22:49.896 --> 22:52.517
You finally came through
for me, boys!
你终于熬过来了
为了我，孩子们！

22:52.620 --> 22:54.241
I feel young again.
我感觉又年轻了。

22:54.344 --> 22:55.344
Eugene?
尤金？

22:55.448 --> 22:56.620
Mother?
母亲？

22:56.724 --> 22:58.793
What are you doing
with my bloomers?
你在做什么
和我的灯笼裤？

22:58.896 --> 23:00.448
Well... I, uh...
嗯...我，呃...

23:03.068 --> 23:05.413
Why didn't you tell me
this was my mother's house?
你为什么不告诉我
这是我母亲的房子？

23:05.517 --> 23:06.862
Why didn't you ask?
你为什么不问？

23:08.310 --> 23:09.379
Uh... ooh.
呃...哦。

23:09.482 --> 23:11.758
But it was all SpongeBob
and Patrick's idea!
但这都是海绵宝宝
和帕特里克的想法！

23:11.862 --> 23:13.344
Go to your room, mister.
去你的房间吧，先生。

23:13.448 --> 23:15.586
You're grounded
for the rest of the night.
你被接地了
剩下的夜晚。

23:15.689 --> 23:17.379
Yes, Mommy.
是的，妈妈。

23:19.655 --> 23:20.793
Don't worry, pops.
别担心，爸爸。

23:20.896 --> 23:21.936
We're almost to your room.
我们快到你的房间了。

23:24.551 --> 23:27.689
Sorry, Mr. Krabs.
对不起，蟹老板。

23:27.793 --> 23:29.758
Ah, that's all right, lad.
啊，没关系，小伙子。

23:29.862 --> 23:32.724
I certainly feel younger.
我当然感觉自己更年轻了。

23:32.827 --> 23:33.827
Good night, Mr. Krabs.
晚安，蟹老板。

23:33.862 --> 23:35.586
Good night, SpongeBob.
晚安，海绵宝宝。

23:35.689 --> 23:37.586
Eugene, lights out!
尤金，熄灯！

23:37.689 --> 23:38.931
Yes, Mommy.
是的，妈妈。

